        'A deepfake is a video, audio clip or image generated or manipulated with deep learning so that it looks or sounds authentic. The name is a blend of deep learning and fake. Classic examples include swapping one person’s face onto another’s body in a video, or cloning someone’s voice to put words in their mouth.',
